# Phase 1 Part 2 (Domain Models) & Part 3 (Storage Layer)

**Updation Date:** 2026-07-25

## Changes Made
- Implemented core domain models (`AccountRecord`, `TransactionRecord`, `AlertRecord`, `FeatureSet`).
- Implemented agent contract schemas (`QuerySpec`, `PlanStep`, `ExecutionPlan`, `ToolResult`, `AgentResponse`).
- Implemented audit log models (`AuditEvent`, `ToolCallLog`, `RunMetadata`).
- Implemented risk assessment schemas (`RiskAssessment`, `FlaggedItem`).
- Updated SQL schema (`sql/duckdb_schema.sql`) adding `feature_cache`, `audit_log`, and `risk_assessments` tables.
- Implemented `DuckDBClient` connection and schema manager in `src/storage/duckdb.py`.
- Implemented typed repository layer (`AccountRepo`, `TransactionRepo`, `AlertRepo`, `AuditRepo`, `FeatureRepo`) in `src/storage/repositories.py`.
- Created and executed `scripts/load_data.py`, ingesting IBM AMLSim synthetic dataset (10,000 accounts, 1,323,234 transactions, 1,719 alerts) into `activity.duckdb`.
- Created comprehensive test suites `tests/test_models.py` and `tests/test_storage.py`.

